WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.510
You...

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.480
What are you doing here?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:06.730
Ow!

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.220
Hawthorn.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.740
You were trying to get yourself killed, 
weren't you?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.820
That wasn't my intention.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.610
I just didn't want 
to back off again.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.240
That's all.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:18.920
<i>Honestly...</i>

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.800
<i>The influence of his journey, perhaps?</i>

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.240
What now?

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.220
Oh, nothing.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.200
Hey!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.510
Are you the one who blocked my lightning?

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.010
I am Winnie.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.110
The Witch of the Western Forest, Winnie.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.490
Now, while I did burst in back there,

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.550
Horror and Resentment

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:14.610
I have no intention of fighting you.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.740
I came just to give Hawthorn this.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.870
Is this... a sword?

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:25.280
I looked into my crystal ball

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.830
and saw you fighting with a wooden sword,

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.000
so I came rushing down to drop it off.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.160
And...

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.450
maybe you're in the right place for it.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.310
What's with this sword?

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.140
It almost feels as if it has a heartbeat.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.810
Scary sword.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.890
It looks perfectly ordinary to me.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.730
No, it's very dangerous.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.140
Its name is Air, the treasure of heaven.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.780
Frau used to carry it.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.580
Huh?

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.950
Heaven? Frau?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.650
I won't say any more.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.740
What matters is that it belongs to Frau,

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.910
and it has quite a history.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.610
It can cut through anything it wants to.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.170
Be it ogre flesh or lightning,

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.790
there is nothing it cannot cut through.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:19.330
The rest depends on your skill wielding it.

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.800
I see.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.050
I won't be losing, then.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:31.230
That one little sword has given you 
a shot of confidence.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.130
How do you expect a metal sword 
to fare against one made of lightning?

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.760
Dunno.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:39.190
It'd be suicide with a normal sword, but...

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.840
If that witch says it'll work,

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.220
I expect that it will.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.270
If you think you can cut 
through an ogre's lightning,

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:51.250
go ahead and try!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.860
That's all over.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.090
I should move to support Todoroki next.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.380
You... How are you alive?!

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.180
I hit you with my cannon 
at close range!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:22.210
Atla left Frau with some power then...

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.610
So Frau can still fight.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.420
You...

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.310
You're no mere harefolk!

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.990
I was of no use at all.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.760
The disgrace!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.680
Forgive me, Todoroki.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.450
I can't stay with you.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.030
Hawthorn.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.880
Coming now.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.180
Coming... to save...

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.920
Even a high ogre is nothing 
without their horn!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.020
I won't let you escape.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:26.430
I need you to die, Meki!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:27.700
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>The only way to pierce Shinki's body...</i>

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.530
Bad luck, running right into a dead end.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:01.040
I think it's time to end this.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.800
<i>I'll just have to risk it!</i>

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.170
<i>If his stretching ability 
can cancel out my force...</i>

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.060
I thought you couldn't fire your cannon!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.180
<i>Got him!</i>

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.810
That was <i>xian dao</i>! I was bluffing!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.460
I just needed a chance to hit you 
at full power,

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.190
with your back against the wall!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.740
With your back against the wall, 
you can't stretch backwards!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:47.010
What do you expect to protect, 
while relying on such an unknown power?

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.760
Oh, shut up.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.580
Even if I can't use my eye's power,

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.270
I will still protect them!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.630
Now, let's go!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:03.520
I'll break past you 
and save my friends!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.470
How very impressive.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.780
I surrender.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.160
Were you teasing me?

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:17.210
I was testing you.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.550
That's a dangerous power, you know.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:23.290
I wanted to assess the mettle 
of the person wielding it.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.200
Sumeragi...

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.980
I thought you were a nice person,

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.300
but you're actually very unpleasant.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.620
I've lost a great deal in my time.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:33.800
I can't but be a little twisted by it.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:39.430
Do you know why my eye 
didn't react to you?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:42.430
Hawthorn's on the verge of death out there.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:45.060
Should you really be standing around 
making small talk?

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.220
Oh, right!

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.870
I won't stop you again.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:48.970
You can go.

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:51.070
Right... Thank you!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.310
<i>"Thank you," eh?</i>

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:54.820
Sumeragi!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.040
Once I figure things out with Mikoto,

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.730
I'll be the one 
extending my hand to you!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.550
Ogre and human coexistence...

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:04.960
Don't forget!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.960
Yes. I'm sure I won't.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.790
Thanks!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.910
Well, see you later!

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.600
Yeah, later.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.530
I-Impossible!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.540
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.210
Don't let him get near you.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.680
He'll electrocute you with a touch!

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.520
He can't even control his own power, eh?

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.570
What do you want?

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:16.060
I've been ordered to work with you.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.700
My name is Meki.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.350
What is this?

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.550
A present.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:25.440
It will suppress your ogre power.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:29.840
Greater discretion in the use of your power 
will yield much better results.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.720
What? Has he lost it completely?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:50.170
Raijin Ogre Thunder... 
One more time!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.750
Guess I lost.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:59.740
Shinki...

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.770
You just beat someone 
trying to kill you.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.790
So why... Meki...

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.250
Why do you look so pained?

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.280
You and Todoroki haven't suffered 
at the hands of humans.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.690
So why?

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.090
Listen, Meki.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:21.070
How do you think humans see me?

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:24.260
Because of the way I look,

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:27.050
the humans I encounter 
don't call me an ogre.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:29.270
They call me a monster!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.980
The same happens among ogres.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:36.020
I was despised by other ogres 
for my grotesque form.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:39.280
Todoroki was the only one...

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.160
What's the big deal? 
You've just got long arms.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.990
A nameless mid ogre, eh?

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.820
I'll give you a species name, at least.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:52.360
How about Shinki, "Stretch Ogre"?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.500
He made a place where someone 
like me could belong.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:11:00.010
Those like you and Todoroki could find 
a place among humans, I'm sure.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.530
But...

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.510
I never could.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:07.180
I thought I'd rather you die 
than Todoroki go to join you.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:12.000
It was selfish, but it's the truth.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.150
Crying for me, are you?

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:21.580
For a pathetic thing like me...

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.900
If there were more people 
like you in this world,

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:28.540
perhaps... I, too... could have...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.790
This kid...

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.620
Damn!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.040
How many times can he fire that thing?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.050
Meki...

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.660
Hey, Meki.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:47.930
Yes?

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.850
I was thinking, some day...

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.520
This time, I'll end this!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.690
<i>It's looser and more violent than before.</i>

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.720
<i>Can I cut through it?</i>

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.620
This is the end!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.120
Die in light, Peach Boy!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.420
Wield it with faith.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:14.960
I will.

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.580
You're very strong.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.820
Sorry... Meki...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.910
Impossible.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.110
What is?

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.620
That human...

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.830
He had only a wooden sword,

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.640
yet he showed no fear.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.960
And in the end, he slew 
Master Todoroki with one swipe.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.630
And I cheered him on, 
as I said I would!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.600
Hawthorn's so cool!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.380
Meki?

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.220
Yes?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.610
Meki?

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.220
How are you alive—

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.050
Of course! I must have died!

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:17.930
Calm down, Todoroki.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.890
I'll explain everything.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.940
It really is you?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.840
You're not dead?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.990
I'm so glad!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:35.800
Huh?

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.570
Hawthorn, you don't need 
to meet with that ogre boy?

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.000
No, I'm leaving it to Carrot.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.260
I see.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.850
Perfect, then!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.140
And we get to see Winnie again, too!

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.760
Yeah. Been a while, Sally.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:54.770
But Hawthorn... wasn't that boy
 you fought really strong?

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:59.030
It's pretty amazing that you beat him 
without killing him!

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:04.220
Well, I certainly meant to kill him.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:05.650
I hated him.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.990
He killed Barsus.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.210
He killed an innocent man.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:13.580
But...

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.960
He only attacked me because 
he thought I'd killed Carrot.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.750
If I'd tried harder to explain, 
maybe we could've resolved things amicably.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.210
Why didn't you?

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:31.510
If he'd understood, and I'd sheathed my sword, 
it would have ended there.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.850
But...

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.600
where would that have left my resentment?

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:41.730
W-Well... That's all very inconvenient...

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:47.010
So let's just forget that 
and find a way without fighting!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:52.500
You know, I get 
what you're getting at, but...

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.350
I know that's a bad way of putting it.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.000
But it's a very Sally answer.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.750
But do you know where you're headed next?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.000
No.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:06.180
Keep traveling east from here, 
and you'll find a country.

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:07.880
Its name is Legedia.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:12.340
It's the one place in the world 
that has outlawed discrimination.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.600
Outlawed discrimination?

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:18.980
I'll kill you!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:20.850
Ogres...

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:23.100
I have to kill the ogres...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.610
Then Master Hiko will stay I'm good...

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.480
Hey, Mikoto...

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.110
I'm back!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.680
Hey, Mikoto.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.110
You're finally up?

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:32.990
I'll kill—

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.500
You're going to have to wake up already!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:44.930
I'm sorry.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.250
I said, "I'm back."

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:52.350
Um... Welcome back.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:56.040
I'm surprised that you didn't bat an eye.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.510
Is that the fortitude of a former ogre?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:03.750
I figured you'd wake up in a bad mood 
after one of Daminki's naps.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.020
"Daminki"?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.010
Yeah.

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:09.780
A dangerous ogre that puts anyone 
who comes near him to sleep.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:16.330
I heard he gives nightmares 
to anyone he puts to sleep.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.600
Nightmares?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.290
Oh, the tournament!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.660
What about it?

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.920
The 300 gold reward...

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.460
Don't you know what's going on?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.420
The tournament's off!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.050
Oh?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.810
Well, I'm heading back now.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.280
Aw...

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.180
Don't be so disappointed.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:48.570
I'll be checking in on you every day, 
so don't worry.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.180
No one likes a peeping Tom.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:52.530
See you later.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.020
There she goes.

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:05.580
But what will you do, Todoroki?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:09.210
What do you mean by that?

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:13.480
Well... You could join us!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.620
Sally! Are you kidding me?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.600
He's an ogre! 
He's killed people!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.830
I know.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:24.730
I'm not saying he should travel with us.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.100
He can remain an ogre 
and coexist with people as an ogre.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.320
I want you to find a way 
to make that work!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.860
Are you nuts? We were just trying 
to kill each other!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:41.120
Only because someone else lied 
about us killing Carrot.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.370
Well... True.

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.980
There are many kinds of ogres out there.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.670
We might not be able to
 join hands with all of them,

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.340
but with some, 
a little effort made it possible.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.270
I think you're one that's worth the effort.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.260
That's why I'm offering you my hand.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.890
I don't understand!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.100
Will you live for nothing,

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.890
or live for something that matters to you?

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:08.140
It's that kind of choice.

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:11.430
Something that matters to me?

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.150
Frau's so cool!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.830
<i>I've always fought and killed 
whatever I was asked to.</i>

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.940
<i>I thought that's what it meant to live.</i>

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.330
<i>But...</i>

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.150
<i>Something that matters to me...</i>

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:28.340
Todoroki? What's wrong?

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.920
N-Nothing!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.760
It might be Sumeragi's influence,

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.220
but more ogres are joining 
the coexistence faction,

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.800
and it's causing friction.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:48.560
Joining hands might be 
to our mutual benefit.

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:54.110
However...

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.240
That hurt!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:00.090
I don't join hands with humans!

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.390
I'll work my own way.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.560
You do whatever you want.

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.180
If I may translate:

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.480
"I'm too embarrassed to shake your hand,"

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:15.000
"so let's seek coexistence together, 
in separate ways."

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.610
Meki! How dare you!

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:20.580
You've always been bad 
at expressing your feelings!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.010
I'm leaving!

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:25.640
Are you sure, Carrot?

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.280
You don't want to go with him?

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:29.040
Don't.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.120
I'll be traveling around ogres.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:35.910
A hornless wonder would just get in my way.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:38.400
You should stay with them.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.810
Well, that was the plan!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:42.160
What a creep.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:47.660
<i>She lost her horn, but her expression 
and her manner are gentler than before.</i>

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:52.040
<i>There's a place where ogres 
who've lost their ogrehood can belong.</i>

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:56.040
Take care of that place 
where you belong, Meki.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.920
You don't need to tell me that!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:04.100
Todoroki's a nice kid after all!

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.410
Only to Carrot, though.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:07.930
What do you mean?

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.900
You don't realize?

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.300
<i>How curious.</i>

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.700
<i>To feel myself inspired by humans...</i>

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.850
<i>But it doesn't feel bad.</i>

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:22.310
<i>At the very least,</i>

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:26.950
<i>I can trust them more 
than I can trust him!</i>

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.510
Watch where you throw that. 
You almost hit me!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.430
Meki wasn't dead!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.290
There was no Peach Boy!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.210
Why did you trick me?!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.880
She's lost her horn.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.720
She's as good as dead, isn't she?

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.850
You tried to make us fight!

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.590
What are you really after?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.210
You wound me!

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.450
I'm the head of the coexistence faction!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.600
We wouldn't have done this 
if not for your lies.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.210
Shinki and Basoo died for this!

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:56.890
Indeed they did.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:06.610
As a token of my apology, 
I'll send you to join them.

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.190
Sume... You...

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.720
No need to thank me.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.330
But oh, I know...

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:25.630
Tell that lot in heaven 
that Sumeragi says, "hello."

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:37.900
Now...

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:43.990
I believe my next destination was Legedia.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:46.950
Isn't that nice?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.410
It's going just as I planned.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.410
I'll get to see something 
even more interesting soon.

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:50.250
Ideals and Reality

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:49.290
Next Time: "Ideals and Reality."
